; Example journal demonstrating two known parsing issues.
; Run: ldash --file examples/prefixed-commodity-comments.journal
;
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Issue 1 – percent (%) comment lines
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; hledger only recognises ;  #  and * as comment characters.
; A % at the start of a line causes an immediate parse error:
;
;   hledger: Error: …:1:1:
;     | % a comment is here
;     | ^ unexpected '%' expecting end of input or transaction or directive
;
; To reproduce, remove the leading ; from the line below and run hledger:
;   % this line breaks hledger
;
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Issue 2 – prefixed commodity symbols  (symbol placed BEFORE the amount)
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; All monetary amounts below use prefix notation: Eur 100, USD 50.
; hledger stores these correctly, but its CSV output keeps the prefix
; layout ("Eur 100"), which previously caused ldash to silently drop
; every amount because parse_amount_str only handled suffix format.
;
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Setup
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

2025-12-31 Opening balances                       ; bootstrap accounts tab
    assets:bank:checking        Eur 4500
    assets:bank:savings         Eur 12000
    assets:cash:wallet          Eur 250
    assets:savings:usd          USD 800           ; foreign-currency pocket
    equity:opening-balances

; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; 2026-01
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

2026-01-31 Salary                                 ; income:salary with prefix Eur
    assets:bank:checking        Eur 2800
    income:salary

2026-01-05 Rent
    expenses:housing:rent       Eur 800
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-08 Groceries
    expenses:food               Eur 145           ; who:jozef
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-12 Public transport
    expenses:transport          Eur 55
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-15 Freelance – USD client                 ; USD income (prefix)
    assets:savings:usd          USD 400
    income:freelance

2026-01-18 Streaming subscription
    expenses:entertainment      Eur 15
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-22 Cash withdrawal
    assets:cash:wallet          Eur 100
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-25 Pharmacy                               ; negative prefix in CSV: Eur -xx
    expenses:health             Eur 38
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-28 Savings transfer
    assets:bank:savings         Eur 300
    assets:bank:checking

